# AYOUNI house repository: what stays on this machine, and what never goes online.

# Local to this machine
.claude/
prompts/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
scratch/

# Built by tools/build_site.py (GitHub Actions rebuilds it from the pinned books)
site/

# No PDF or ePub online unless the author says so (DECISIONS HOUSE-05, HOUSE-11): a download the registry lists is added with `git add -f`
*.pdf
*.epub

# Beginning Ring Programming (Apress, 2020): the manuscript files are Apress's property and never go public (HOUSE-06).
# The archive keeps its own history in a git directory kept outside the house (HOUSE-06, HOUSE-09);
# the house tracks only its README, its CLAUDE.md and the study of the writing.
books/ring-book/*
!books/ring-book/README.md
!books/ring-book/CLAUDE.md
!books/ring-book/style/
